  "description": "**Integrated Multi-satellite Retrievals for GPM (IMERG) - Final Run**\n\nThe Final Run provides research-quality precipitation estimates by fusing data from the GPM constellation and calibrating with ground gauge networks.\n\n- **Temporal Resolution**: 30 minutes\n- **Spatial Resolution**: 0.1\u00b0 x 0.1\u00b0\n- **Latency**: ~3.5 months (post-processing)\n\nIdeal for historical analysis and climatology studies.\n",
